    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_body">Reads incoming SMS and uploads them to your account on the SMS Forwarder backend, which forwards each message to the channels you configured (Telegram).\n\nSign in once on this phone; the device stays signed in. Configure channels in the app — they are stored on the server and tied to your account, so messages are never delivered to the wrong user.\n\nCapture: a real-time SMS broadcast receiver (works even when the app process has been killed), plus an optional periodic reconciliation that re-uploads anything missed. Upload is queued via WorkManager and retried until it succeeds, surviving process death and reboot.\n\nSurvival: a persistent foreground service, auto-restart on boot, battery-optimization exemption, and OEM auto-start whitelisting keep it running long-term.\n\nFor personal use.</string>
